    "name": "Session 08 - HTTP and REST demo",
    "description": "Demo collection for Session 8.\n\n1. HttpBasics (local): start the server first with `java demos/HttpBasics.java serve` from files/session-08.\n2. JSONPlaceholder (public): needs internet, no setup.\n\nEvery request has a Tests tab that checks the status code. Run the whole collection with the Runner to see them all pass.",
